"P3841339890" "While you were off testing the Infected anti-serum I was contacted by a member of Arachnos who says he has more information on the source of the contaminant in the water which produces the Infected. Unfortunately, the idiot got himself captured by Longbow before he was able to deliver me the information! Fortunately, I managed to find the warehouse where they took him for interrogation. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break into the warehouse and capture the Arachnos informant from Longbow!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2713175444" "Rescue Arachnos informant"
// SendOffString :
"P3680095958" "Bring me back the Arachnos informant intact! He's useless to me unconscious!"
