"P349256388" "WHAT? The informant was taken down? You fool!<br><br>But the informant did mention Doctor Geist! Doctor Geist was once a colleague of mine who stole my mutation theories for himself!  Arachnos is letting one of my greatest rivals run medical experiments in their labs? And the waste from these experiments is what is causing the Infected? I must know what he is up to!"

