// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2389506551" "So my old rival Doctor Geist sold out to Arachnos and is doing medical experiments for them, eh? And the waste from those experiments is ending up in the cesspools of Mercy and causing the Infected to come about? I must know more about those experiments! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break into Fort Cerberus and get the information out of Doctor Geist!</A>"
